traditional key signatures are supported.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The optional number attribute refers to staff numbers. If absent, the key signature applies to all staves in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the part. Key signatures appear at the start of each system unless the print-object attribute has been set to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"“no”.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlkey"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLKey/Octave-swift.struct":{"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Octave","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLKey\/Octave-swift.struct","title":"MXLKey.Octave","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Octave","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"The key-octave type specifies in which octave an element of a key signature appears. The content specifies the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"octave value using the same values as the display-octave element. The number attribute is a positive integer","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that refers to the key signature element in left-to-right order. If the cancel attribute is set to yes, then"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"this number refers to the canceling key signature specified by the cancel element in the parent key element."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The cancel attribute cannot be set to yes if there is no corresponding cancel element within the parent key"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"element. It is no by default.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlkey\/octave-swift.struct"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLKey/Octave-swift.struct/value":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"value"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Int","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"}],"role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The value of this element."}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlkey\/octave-swift.struct\/value","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLKey\/Octave-swift.struct\/value","title":"value"}}}